WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:03.820
How many times do we have to tell you?

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.630
When you're watching TV,
get your face away from it!

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:14.000
Rizel, how much longer
are you going to sleep?

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:16.690
