00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.580
No, Darling...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.760
Let's go together...

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.560
H-H-Hey now, Rizel...

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.220
What's that?

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.110
