00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.140
Oh no, it wasn't any trouble.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:34.520
Still, you Mamas certainly are young and beautiful.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.660
Huh?

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:38.360
