00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.640
Iwaki Tomonori-kun...

00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.520
Yeah?

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.560
Reach "C" with Rizel!

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.690
"C"?!?!

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.440
Did she say "C"?

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.220
Is that what they're
calling it these days?

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:10.880
