00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.400
"C"...? "C"...!!

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:24.120
H-Hey! Do you even know what "C" <i>means?!</i>

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.820
A super-hot-and-heavy kiss!
(<u>c</u>houbuatsui kuchizuke)

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:30.130
No, Rizel. It is not a
super-hot-and-heavy kiss.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.010
This is the "adult" C.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.920
So then... it really is...!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.420
The "adult" C?

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.330
As in "cilia"? Or maybe "cheap candy"?

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.130
The "adult C" is...!

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:42.430
"Adult"

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.800
