00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.710
The only way to achieve that is the "adult C."

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:59.220
If you don't do it, Rizel will remain like this
for the rest of her life.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.300
I see, I see... I didn't know that.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.470
What's the big deal?

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.980
Don't you also want her to grow up?

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:07.430
